@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-66 - Filter by Date Range

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Analytics UI" as FE
control "AnalyticsController" as API
control "AnalyticsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-66
FE -> API: GET /analytics/overview?from=&to=
API -> Service: Execute Filter by Date Range
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Dữ liệu được lọc theo khoảng thời gian

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở dashboard
Post: Dữ liệu được lọc theo khoảng thời gian
Main flow:
1. Admin chọn date range (today, 7 days, 30 days, custom)
2. System gọi API với query params from/to
3. Tất cả charts cập nhật theo range đã chọn
end note
@enduml
